================================================================================
KEY XML TAGS EXPLANATION (VIVA REFERENCE):
================================================================================
1. <ImageUrl>      : Path to the image file to be displayed as the banner ad.
2. <NavigateUrl>   : The URL/website opened when the user clicks the ad.
3. <AlternateText> : Tooltip/alt text displayed if image fails to load or on hover.
4. <Impressions>   : Relative weight/frequency of the ad appearing upon page refresh.
